      "text": [
        "Cures of Dimensionality",
        "Exact analytic solution exists only for one-body system.",
        "• Many-body systems require consideration of electron-electron repulsion.",
        "In computational chemistry, approximations are",
        "made to solve many-body problems.",
        "• Wavefunction theory (WFT) directly approximates the wavefunction.",
        "• Density functional theory (DFT) replaces the high-dimensional wavefunction",
        "with three-dimensional electron density function in every calculation.",
        "6"
