        "Wavefunction Theory (WFT)",
        "WFT methods attempts to directly approximate the wavefunction.",
        "• Hartree-Fock (HF) theory: Approximates the Hamiltonian using mean-field model,",
        "i.e., electrons interact with the average potential, in place of electron-electron repulsion.",
        "• Post-Hartree-Fock methods: Aims to correct the missing “correlation energy”",
        "through coupled cluster theory (CC) or Møller-Plesset perturbation theory (MP2).",
        "Much accurate but expensive.",
